<section id="how-it-works" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-16 border-t border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626]">
  
  <!-- Section 1: What is PDF Metadata? -->
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#171717] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-xs font-mono text-[#888888] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">
      <span>PDF METADATA EXPLAINED</span>
    </div>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
      What is PDF Metadata?
    </h2>

    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed">
      A PDF (Portable Document Format) file does not just contain visible text, images, and pages. It also embeds hidden document properties known as <strong>PDF metadata</strong>. This information is automatically written when a document is generated, exported, or converted by word processors, PDF editors, or desktop publishing software.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] bg-white dark:bg-[#111111] space-y-2 card-hairline">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-[#888888] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] uppercase tracking-wider">📄 Document Information Dictionary</div>
        <ul class="text-xs text-[#171717] dark:text-white space-y-1.5 font-mono list-disc list-inside">
          <li><strong>Author:</strong> Full name or computer username of document creator</li>
          <li><strong>Title & Subject:</strong> Internal document titles and summaries</li>
          <li><strong>Creator:</strong> Software used to draft document (Word, InDesign)</li>
          <li><strong>Producer:</strong> PDF conversion engine or printer driver</li>
          <li><strong>Keywords:</strong> Indexed tags and search keywords</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] bg-white dark:bg-[#111111] space-y-2 card-hairline">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-[#888888] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] uppercase tracking-wider">⚙️ Embedded Timestamps & XMP</div>
        <ul class="text-xs text-[#171717] dark:text-white space-y-1.5 font-mono list-disc list-inside">
          <li><strong>Creation Date:</strong> Exact timestamp document was first generated</li>
          <li><strong>Modification Date:</strong> Exact timestamp of last edit</li>
          <li><strong>XMP Metadata Stream:</strong> Extensible XML metadata payloads</li>
          <li><strong>File History:</strong> Application versions and revision logs</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

